OL,3,GNorth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FIt will
OL,6,Fremain dry this evening and overnight
OL,7,Fwith clear skies. Temperatures fall
OL,8,Faway to leave a cold night and a
OL,9,Fwidespread frost with a few mist and
OL,10,Ffreezing fog patches forming.
OL,11,
OL,12,CThursday:FA frosty start, but plenty
OL,13,Fof autumnal sunshine through Thursday.
OL,14,FIt will stay dry but feel rather cold
OL,15,Fin the brisk northerly breeze.
OL,16,FOvernight, another widespread frost
OL,17,Funder clear skies.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
